Song Title: The Lord Almighty Reigns
Artist / Author:
Writers: Words and Music by Keith & Kristyn Getty, Matt Boswell and Matt Papa
Release year: 2022
CCLI song #: 7207247
Order: Verse 1, Verse 2, Chorus, Verse 3, Chorus, Chorus

Verse 1
There’s an endless song waiting to be sung
With the voice of every tribe
The sound of every tongue
When the bride of Christ on that day of days
Brings with joy unto the Lamb
A multitude of praise
Like the roar of mighty seas
And rolls of thunder, hear His people sing:

Verse 2
We will join the feast, rest from battles won
Tell with great rejoicing
All the wonders God has done
And like the roar of mighty seas
And rolls of thunder, all the church will sing:

Chorus
Hallelujah, hallelujah
For the Lord Almighty reigns!
Hallelujah, hallelujah
For the Lord, our God, the Almighty reigns!

Verse 3
Certain of that day, Christ we will proclaim
Oh, that more would share the prize
Salvation in His name
Then greater will the anthem ring
A mighty chorus rising to the King:

Chorus
Hallelujah, hallelujah
For the Lord Almighty reigns!
Hallelujah, hallelujah
For the Lord, our God, the Almighty reigns!

Chorus
Hallelujah, hallelujah
For the Lord Almighty reigns!
Hallelujah, hallelujah
For the Lord, our God, the Almighty reigns!
